OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA partly cloudy start with the
OL,6,Fodd spot of rain possible. Bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells at times for most but
OL,8,Fwith the potential for light rain
OL,9,Facross eastern Kent and the odd shower
OL,10,Felsewhere. Light winds with
OL,11,Ftemperatures around average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with clear
OL,14,Fspells initially. Cloud building but
OL,15,Fsome clear spells remain allowing
OL,16,Fwidespread mist and some fog to
OL,17,Fdevelop. Cold with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
