OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FRemaining partly cloudy with
OL,6,Fmist and fog patches to start. These
OL,7,Fslowly clear to leave a bright day
OL,8,Fwith some sunny spells and isolated
OL,9,Fcoastal showers. Temperatures close to
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure remains dominant. Variable
OL,14,Fcloud with the odd spot of rain on
OL,15,FSunday, but becoming drier and
OL,16,Fbrighter for Monday and Tuesday. Light
OL,17,Fwinds and temperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
